  "description": "This single security gate has 130\" wide. Under the same conditions, the larger extension size is more suitable for courtyards, garages, warehouses and other scenes\nFeatures\nEnlarged Size:Yitamotor single security gate has 130\" wide. Under the same conditions, the larger extension size is more suitable for courtyards, garages, warehouses and other scenes\nDouble Folding Door Gate: Yitamotor folding security gate presents a single folding design with a retractable door, offering versatility and adaptability; The accordion security gate expands to 61\" height and 130\" width, providing comprehensive coverage for entrances and doorways.The standard size is suitable for use as safety doors, barricade gates seeking protection and defend\n360°Rolling Casters: This scissor gate is equipped with 2 rolling casters at the bottom, allowing the gate to swing up to 360 degrees; The casters also feature a lock design to fix the gate's position, ensuring both mobility and stability\nAluminium Alloy Mesh and Anti-Theft Bolts: The side folding gate incorporates an aluminum alloy mesh with 44 3/4\" square tubes, offering lightweight yet robust protection; The fence security gate is secured with anti-theft bolts, enhancing the gate's security features\nDurable Construction: The flexible expanding security gate is crafted from heavy-duty 3/4\" 24 gauge channel steel with powder finish, ensuring durability and longevity; The unique non-interference design effectively safeguards your property and prevents unwanted intrusions\nWide Application: The stretchable door gate includes a padlock for easy locking and a set of mounting tools for effortless installation; Fit for use at home or in industrial settings, enhancing security in basements, garages, storefronts, and more",
